- @congress1

@congress1
title: What of the WHG?
#on-arrival: kpd_party_leader = "Conciliators"; communist_coalition += 3; kpd_relation += 10*(1-dissent); left_strength += 5; left_dissent -= 8

Unexpectedly, the Western Hills Group have outrighted refused to join what they perceive as a Bolshevik farce. This may have the effect of forcing centrists to pick sides.

